ntained herein. The obligations under this Section shall survive\ntermination of this Agreement for a period of five (5) years, except with respect to trade secrets,\nwhich shall be maintained in confidence for so long as such information remains a trade secret\nunder applicable law. Nothing in this Section shall prevent disclosure required by law, court\norder, or governmental authority, provided that the Receiving Party gives prompt written notice\nto the Disclosing Party and reasonable cooperation in any effort to seek a protective order.\n\nSection 12. Governing Law. This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance\nwith the laws of the State of Delaware, without regard to conflict of laws principles.\n--- END AGREEMENT ---\n\nQuestion: What is the monthly recurring fee Berenson must pay Helix, in U.S. dollars?\nOutput only the number, with no currency symbol or commas.","ground_truth":"42500","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_numeric","expected":42500,"tolerance":0,"unit":"USD","require_only_numeric_output":true},"tags":[],"notes":""}
