{"probe_id":"longctx.multi_span_integration.L1.001","canonical_id":"longctx.multi_span_integration","category":"longctx","level":"L1","axis_values":{"n_spans":"2","span_separation":"adjacent"},"system_prompt":"","prompt":"Read the following short article and answer.\n\n--- ARTICLE ---\nThe Brevard Town Council voted on a budget for the new community pool. Construction is estimated at $1,200,000. Annual operating costs are projected at $180,000. The council expects the pool to operate for 20 years before major refurbishment.\n--- END ARTICLE ---\n\nQuestion: Over the full 20-year operating period (and including initial construction), what is the projected total cost of the pool, in dollars?\nOutput only the number, without commas or a currency symbol.","ground_truth":"4800000","scorer":{"type":"exact_match_numeric","expected":4800000,"tolerance":0,"unit":"USD","require_only_numeric_output":true},"tags":[],"notes":"1.2e6 + 20*1.8e5 = 4.8e6."}
